client_secret*.json

# Private material: anything third-party, copyrighted or personal
**/private/
*.local.md

# Your content lives under SHORTS_POSTS_DIR / SHORTS_DATA_DIR, never in the repo.
# Anchored with a leading slash so they match only at the top level.
/posts/
/data/

# Agents
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

